"input.guide.clock.compat" = "数字 · 自定义";
"input.guide.clock.body" = "全黑屏幕——就像手机关机一样。滑动手势使用方向对对数字0到9进行编码：每个数字需要恰好两次连续滑动（例如 ↑↑ = 0，↑→ = 1，→→ = 3）。可以输入任意长度的数字。";
"input.guide.clock.activate" = "The black screen opens automatically when the active set uses Number Clock. Swipe pairs to build your number digit by digit — each completed pair gives a short vibration. Stop swiping for 3 seconds to confirm and fire the reveal. Tap anywhere after confirmation to dismiss the black screen.";
"input.guide.clock.tip" = "与数字格编码相同：如果你熟悉数字格，时钟完全一样。唯一的区别是完全黑屏，没有可见的格子。";
